"title":"Bhajahu̐ Re Mana"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":168,"first_line":"ki-rūpe pāibo sevā mui durāchāra","author":"Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"},"title":["Ki-rūpe pāibo sevā"],"author":["by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["ki-rūpe pāibo sevā mui durāchāra","śrī-guru-vaiṣṇave rati na hoilo āmāra"],"translation":["I have no devotional attachment for either the Vaiṣṇavas or my Spiritual Master. How is it possible for a rascal like me to attain devotional service?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["aśeṣa māyāte mana magana hoilo","vaiṣṇavete leśa-mātra rati nā janmilo"],"translation":["My mind is always drowning in illusion. I have not even the smallest fragment of devotion for the Vaiṣṇavas."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["biṣoye bhuliya andha hoinu divā-niśi","gole phā̐sa dite phere māyā se piśāchī"],"translation":["I have become blind by constantly meditating on the objects of the senses. The witch Māyādevī has placed a hangman’s noose around my neck."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["māyāre koriyā jaya chāḍāna na jāya","sādhu-kṛpā vinā āro nahiko upāya"],"translation":["Even if I can cure my blindness and defeat Māyā in the form of this hangman, I cannot become free from material illusion without the mercy of the saintly devotees."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["adoṣa daraśi-prabhu patita-uddhāra","ei-bāro narottame karaho nistāra"],"translation":["Oh master, Oh purifier of the sinful, Oh saviour of the fallen souls, you do not see the faults of others, please rescue this Narottam Dās."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.N. Acharya Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/kostya-netrebenko/015-kirupepaibaseva-7","personSlug":"srila-b-n-acharya-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/ki-rupe-paibo-seva","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":null},"head":{"canonical":"/en-2022/ki-rupe-paibo-seva-mui-durachara/","description":"Ki-rūpe pāibo sevā — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Ki-rūpe pāibo sevā. by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-2022","slug":"ki-rupe-paibo-seva-mui-durachara"}}